                </span>
              </div>
              <p className="text-xs text-textSecondary leading-relaxed">
                Calculated to balance forehead height with your {result?.jawlineShape || "defined"} jawline. The horizontal fringe softens vertical elongation while maintaining prominent cheekbone definition.
